WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
There is crime in American cities,

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.560
but the way to deal with it is get the funding

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.600
that you need for police, get the training that you need,

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.800
and work with local officials.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.480
This is a pretext to stop the next election.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.320
Why would Trump want to stop blacks in Chicago from voting?

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.320
Every election, he gets bigger black turnout.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.320
Why would he stop it?

